# Optional. When set, the "Start a Project" form POSTs JSON to this URL.
# When unset (the default today), the form still works: it composes your
# message and offers Copy / Gmail / Outlook / mail app. Nothing is broken.
#
# WARNING: every VITE_ value is inlined into the PUBLIC JavaScript bundle at
# build time. Only ever put a public form endpoint or a public form access key
# here - never an API secret, SMTP credential, or anything with write access.
#
# Adding this later requires a REBUILD AND REDEPLOY, not just an env change.
#
# Known-good, CORS-open, JSON-accepting endpoints:
#   Formspree    https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms    https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (also set the access key below)
#   Basin        https://usebasin.com/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Getform      https://getform.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   or any Cloudflare Worker accepting POST application/json with CORS headers
# Netlify Forms is NOT drop-in: it needs a hidden form-name field and a
# urlencoded body, i.e. a small branch in src/lib/inquiry.js.
VITE_INQUIRY_ENDPOINT=

# Web3Forms only. Public by design; still not a secret store.
VITE_INQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY=
